# HB-SAMPLE (CROSS-PORT): Melee Captain ThrowLw (retail data from the vanilla disc), retargeted by bone role; owner choice: owner 2026-10-11: the grab family is Captain Falcon's (his animation, grab boxes and throw data on Goku's bones); the retarget was approved by eye in Blender (lane ws/goku-falcon-grabs).
# Hitbox joint, size and offsets are Captain's moved to Goku's bone of the same role (a sphere on the root joint is scaled about it) and scaled by the size ratio 0.7570 (script units: build.py multiplies by 1.4286; the engine then applies Goku's built size 1.2 to the fighter, model and hitboxes alike). Damage, angle, KBG/BKB, timing, auto-cancel and IASA are unchanged; left behind: gfx, sfx.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
smash_sfx
throw slot=0 damage=7 angle=65 kbg=34 fkb=0 bkb=75 element=0 sfx_severity=2 sfx_kind=2
throw slot=1 damage=3 angle=361 kbg=100 fkb=0 bkb=60 element=0 sfx_severity=0 sfx_kind=2
wait_until 14
rumble w0.unk1=0 w0.unk2=13 w0.unk3=0
wait_until 20
throw_release
